config AIC8800_USB
	tristate "AICSemi AIC8800 USB support"
	depends on USB
	depends on CFG80211
	select FW_LOADER
	help
	  This driver supports USB variants of the AICSemi AIC8800 family,
	  including the AIC8800D80 used on the Radxa ROCK 4D.

	  Two modules are built: aic_load_fw loads the device firmware and
	  aic8800_fdrv provides the cfg80211 network interface.
